    "body": "### Summary\n\nFinish migrating HTTP handlers from the legacy `EmailService struct` to `Arc<dyn EmailSender>`, then delete EmailService and the TODO in `api/src/email_service.rs`.\n\n\n\n### Problem or Opportunity\n\nEmailService is a thin wrapper around `Arc<dyn EmailSender>` kept for backward compatibility during migration with an explicit TODO to remove it. Call sites still construct `EmailService::new()` in several modules, so the duplicate API surface remains and the migration is incomplete.\n\n### Proposed Approach\n\n1. Replace each `EmailService::new()` usage with the trait object path already used elsewhere.\n2. Where handlers need email, pass `Arc<dyn EmailSender>` from startup / router state instead of constructing per-request where avoidable.\n3. Remove `pub struct EmailService` and its `impl` from `api/src/email_service.rs`, plus any now-unused imports.\n4. Run related tests for the api crate and any touched integration tests.\n\n\n\n### Alternatives Considered\n\nTBD\n\n### Mockups, Logs, or References\n\nRemaining call sites:\n- api/src/api/http/admin.rs — 1\n- api/src/api/http/auth.rs — 3\n- api/src/api/http/oauth.rs — 2\n- api/src/api/http/headless.rs — 1\n\nRoot todo:\nhttps://github.com/divinevideo/keycast/blob/6b05d9ecdefd21043a4a5cf7389cb339c32b56e5/api/src/email_service.rs#L525",
